  "post_content": "<p>(8 fotos) La vicepresidenta de la Diputaci&oacute; de Castell&oacute; i responsable de l&#39;&agrave;rea de Benestar Social, Patricia Puerta Barber&agrave;, mediar&agrave; davant la Conselleria d&#39;Igualtat i Pol&iacute;tiques Inclusives perqu&egrave; Tales puga comptar amb un punt d&#39;atenci&oacute; a persones majors. Aix&iacute; ho va traslladat al seu alcalde, Vicente Juan Prades Ramos, durant la visita que va realitzar al municipi divendres 26 d&#39;agost, segons destaca una nota del gabinet de comunicaci&oacute; de la insittuci&oacute; provincial.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciapuertatales/IMG_20220826_120103.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220826_120103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciapuertatales/IMG_20220826_120404.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220826_120404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciapuertatales/IMG_20220826_120439.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220826_120439\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciapuertatales/IMG_20220826_121905.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220826_121905\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciapuertatales/IMG_20220826_121919.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220826_121919\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciapuertatales/IMG_20220826_122346.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220826_122346\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciapuertatales/IMG_20220826_123016.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220826_123016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciapuertatales/IMG_20220826_125